---
description: API booking invariant and concurrency gate
globs: api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- `api/src/__tests__/concurrency.test.ts`: additions only; never remove, skip, or weaken tests (see CLAUDE.md → THE CONCURRENCY GATE).
- Booking invariant: use `store.transaction` with `.immediate()` (`BEGIN IMMEDIATE`); never `.deferred()` or non-transactional paths.
- Do not replace `better-sqlite3` with an async SQLite driver.
